          "heading": "Mark Nawaqanitawase joins Saitama Wild Knights; coach Berrick Barnes hails arrival",
          "body": "Japan club Saitama Wild Knights have welcomed Mark Nawaqanitawase, and backs and attack coach Berrick Barnes is delighted. \"We're so lucky to have him,\" Barnes told AAP from just outside Tokyo. The former Wallabies vice-captain said Nawaqanitawase, who arrived on Thursday, already knew many of the squad's names and had watched footage of how the side plays. Barnes added that he is positive around the group and lifts the Japanese players up."
