          "heading": "Beauden Barrett becomes second All Black to reach 50 Test tries against Scotland",
          "body": "Beauden Barrett's brace in the 43-21 win at Murrayfield on Saturday brought up his half-century of Test tries. Planet Rugby noted the tally also passed Doug Howlett's try-scoring tally. His 49th came earlier, from a Damian McKenzie flat pass after Peter Lakai was sent to the sin bin, and the 50th arrived two minutes after Josh Moorby's try."
