          "heading": "Rassie Erasmus says Salmaan Moerat withdrew from Italy test with back spasms",
          "body": "Salmaan Moerat, who was set to make his first Test appearance of 2026, was replaced at the last minute by Lood de Jager, with Franco Mostert moving onto the bench. Erasmus said Moerat had a minor issue on Thursday, looked good at the captain's run, then got more back spasms in the warm-up, and hoped it was not too serious. Moerat was the only casualty, Erasmus said, and he did not think there were other serious injuries."
